kalkra/store_submission/

# Release symbol maps (release-symbols/) are the DE-OBFUSCATION KEYS for shipped
# builds. This repo is PUBLIC: publishing these fully reverses --obfuscate and
# also leaks local build paths. Track the README only; keep the maps private.
release-symbols/**
!release-symbols/README.md

# Internal project docs live in the private project_docs repo
.project-docs

# Internal docs default to the private project_docs repo. Already-tracked
# public docs (README, PLAYERS_GUIDE, licences, package docs) are unaffected;
# this only stops NEW .md files being swept into the public repo.
*.md
